&& A risk diagram for sign-in, recovery, and a possible conflict.
layout up
Login @1,0 = /User can sign in with username and password/
Blocked @1,1 = \User cannot sign in with username and password\
ForgotPassword @0,2 = \User forgot their password\
ForgotUsername @2,2 = \User forgot their username\
ResetPassword @0,3 = /User can recover their password/
RecoverUsername @2,3 = /User can recover their username with their phone number/

Blocked __> Login
ForgotPassword __> Blocked
ForgotUsername __> Blocked
ResetPassword __> ForgotPassword
RecoverUsername __> ForgotUsername
RecoverUsername __> Login [zigzag] via right : A non-user might gain access
